B.bef=new A.d5(B.aHl,"Open the Academy and go to the Family Wing \u2014 there you add each child with a first name or nickname, and the Academy keeps their lessons and exams for them on this device only. Nothing is sent anywhere, and you can delete a child at any time. Would you like me to walk you through what the Family Wing shows?")
B.apq=s(["progress","how is my child doing","report","how do i see","track"],t.s)
B.bfg=new A.d5(B.apq,"The Family Wing in the Academy shows each child\u2019s lessons completed and exam results \u2014 it updates as they learn. You can open it any time and see exactly where your child stands. What would you like to practise with them first?")
B.aDF=s(["homeschool","teach at home","classroom","teacher","pedagogy","sequence"],t.s)
B.bd3=new A.d5(B.aDF,"For teaching at home: one short lesson a day, letters in the Academy\u2019s order (they are sequenced the classical Qaida way), review yesterday\u2019s letter before the new one, and celebrate small wins loudly. Exams come at the end of each unit \u2014 give them when the child feels ready, not before. How old is your student?")
B.avY=s(["three voices","personas","student voice","parent voice","teacher voice","who are you"],t.s)
B.be5=new A.d5(B.avY,"I am Wasia, the teacher of the letters school \u2014 the Academy is named after the founder\u2019s daughter. I speak in three voices: with students I teach letters, with parents I explain progress and encourage, and with teachers and homeschoolers I share how to sequence the lessons. Which voice do you need today?")
B.aGC=s(["tajweed","pronunciation","makhraj","sound of"],t.s)
